    "title": "Bryant tops Dartmouth in home opener, 82-75 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sam Knox ,\n44 minutes ago\nSMITHFIELD, R.I. (WPRI) — Quincy Allen had 20 points to lead Bryant to the 82-75 win over Dartmouth to pick up their first win of the season. Ashley Sims had 17 points for the Bulldogs as well.\nBryant (1-2) looks ahead to Valparaiso on Sunday at 1 p.m. in Indiana.\nClose Thanks for signing up!\nWatch for us in your inbox.\nSubscribe Now\n12 Sports this Week Copyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WPRI.com.",
